<div class="faq-list">
<details><summary>What is included in the $160 broker licensing option?</summary><p>The package includes the DBPR-approved 72-hour Florida Broker Course 2, course certification, broker exam-prep materials, audio/video instruction, 500+ Q&amp;A, one year of access, a free FastPass book on request, and direct support from Daniel.</p></details>
<details><summary>What does Broker FastPass add?</summary><p>Broker FastPass adds three FastPass exams and a more structured certification and exam-preparation path built around the Florida broker licensing exam.</p></details>
<details><summary>Does FastPass replace the Florida broker licensing exam?</summary><p>No. The Florida broker licensing exam is a separate exam administered through <a href="https://www.pearsonvue.com/us/en/fl/dbpr.html" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Pearson Professional Assessments</a> (formerly Pearson VUE). FastPass is preparation and part of the Course 2 certification path; you still take the state exam separately.</p></details>
<details><summary>What is Broker Career Launch?</summary><p>Broker Career Launch combines Course 2, Broker FastPass, and your required Broker Post-Licensing course so your next education step is already included.</p></details>
<details><summary>Do broker students get the FastPass book?</summary><p>Yes. Broker students can request the printed FastPass book free. Other printed course books are also available on request at no charge.</p></details>
<details><summary>How long do I have access?</summary><p>Broker course bundles include one year of online access.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can I contact the owner directly?</summary><p>Yes. You can text the owner directly at <a href="sms:+12394718500">239.471.8500</a> or email <a href="mailto:daniel@daniellarsontraining.com">daniel@daniellarsontraining.com</a> about broker licensing, exam preparation, post-licensing, or your next licensing step.</p></details>
